WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:17.819
Tom looked in the Royal Ballroom.

2
00:00:17.820 --> 00:00:24.534
Streamers hung from the ceiling.

3
00:00:24.535 --> 00:00:30.112
Servants were putting flowers on the tables.

4
00:00:30.113 --> 00:00:34.075
"What's going on?" Tom asked.

5
00:00:34.076 --> 00:00:38.720
Cat peeked out of Tom's pocket.

6
00:00:38.721 --> 00:00:42.413
"There's a birthday party tomorrow," she said.

7
00:00:42.414 --> 00:00:46.898
"I heard Cook talking about it."

8
00:00:46.899 --> 00:00:50.255
"Whose birthday is it?" Tom asked.

9
00:00:50.256 --> 00:00:53.829
"Prince Eric's," Cat said.

10
00:00:53.830 --> 00:00:57.216
Just then Dirk appeared.

11
00:00:57.217 --> 00:01:01.826
"There you are, fool!" he snapped at Tom.

12
00:01:01.827 --> 00:01:06.486
"The queen wants to see you at once.

13
00:01:06.487 --> 00:01:11.672
Come with me!"

14
00:01:11.673 --> 00:01:18.593
Tom hurried after Dirk to the Throne Room.

15
00:01:18.594 --> 00:01:21.648
Cat was still in his pocket.

16
00:01:21.649 --> 00:01:24.620
"Uh-oh," Tom thought.

17
00:01:24.621 --> 00:01:28.489
"Cat might make the queen sneeze."

18
00:01:28.490 --> 00:01:31.781
The queen sat on her throne.

19
00:01:31.782 --> 00:01:37.816
Tom bowed. "Good morning, Your Majesty."

20
00:01:37.817 --> 00:01:40.358
The queen's nose wriggled.

21
00:01:40.359 --> 00:01:49.539
She pulled out her handkerchief.

22
00:01:49.540 --> 00:01:56.277
"Ah-choo!" The queen sneezed.

23
00:01:56.278 --> 00:02:00.676
"Tom, I need your help again," she said.

24
00:02:00.677 --> 00:02:04.767
"Anything, Your Majesty," Tom said.

25
00:02:04.768 --> 00:02:09.121
The queen blew her nose.

26
00:02:09.122 --> 00:02:13.211
"Prince Eric's birthday is tomorrow," she said.

27
00:02:13.212 --> 00:02:17.457
"And I need a special gift for him."

28
00:02:17.458 --> 00:02:23.628
"What does Prince Eric want?" Tom asked.

29
00:02:23.629 --> 00:02:27.975
"Prince Eric loves animals," the queen said.

30
00:02:27.976 --> 00:02:30.565
"He wants a pet.

31
00:02:30.566 --> 00:02:34.623
I want to get him a dog."

32
00:02:34.624 --> 00:02:38.013
"A dog?" Tom repeated.

33
00:02:38.014 --> 00:02:42.740
Hiss! A loud sound came from Tom's pocket.

34
00:02:42.741 --> 00:02:50.133
Then he felt something sharp—Cat's claws!

